      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SWEXAN (4) bolted in over this track and trip two back before dropping back to 1000m and finding them a touch sharp. Back out in trip now is a bonus and an inside barrier should see him up front from the outset. O'Donnell's claim comes in handy and he can return to winning ways. SHE IS ALL MAGIC (9) was solid from the front over 1000m last start and steps back out to 1200m. Webster's claim comes in handy, and getting back out to 1200m now is a bonus. Expecting a forward showing here. INCANDESCENT LADY (5) has not won for a long while. Last raced on July 10 when beaten 7 lengths into sixth at this track over 1000m after being prominent until the final stages. Can feature in the finish. DRAGONFLIES (7) finished one length away in fifth last time out over 1000m at this track a week-and-a-half ago. Steps up in journey today. The testing material. SHOOTING KONTIKI (3) won't be far away.",
